  "correction": {
    "file": "civiccast/native/gstreamer_runtime.py",
    "change": "register each directory with the Windows loader at most once per process via _REGISTERED_DLL_DIRECTORIES (normcase key), appending the handle only after a successful call",
    "precedent": "civiccast/captions/runtime.py _CUDA_DLL_DIRECTORY_HANDLES",
    "concurrency_review": "no lock added: the probe path runs on the single ChannelAutomationService.run_forever thread; the API only enqueues egress commands. A second future caller could duplicate one registration per thread, which is bounded.",
